G	328262	-	The\x20girl\x20on\x20the\x20summit\x20of\x20the\x20load\x20sat\x20motionless,\x20surrounded\x20by\x20tables\x20and\x20chairs\x20with\x20their\x20legs\x20upwards,\x20backed\x20by\x20an\x20oak\x20settle,\x20and\x20ornamented\x20in\x20front\x20by\x20pots\x20of\x20geraniums,\x20myrtles,\x20and\x20cactuses,\x20together\x20with\x20a\x20caged\x20canary\x20--\x20all\x20probably\x20from\x20the\x20windows\x20of\x20the\x20house\x20just\x20vacated.\x20\x20There\x20was\x20also\x20a\x20cat\x20in\x20a\x20willow\x20basket,\x20from\x20the\x20partly-opened\x20lid\x20of\x20which\x20she\x20gazed\x20with\x20half-closed\x20eyes,\x20and\x20affectionately-surveyed\x20the\x20small\x20birds\x20around.\x20\x20The\x20handsome\x20girl\x20waited\x20for\x20some\x20time\x20idly\x20in\x20her\x20place,\x20and\x20the\x20only\x20sound\x20heard\x20in\x20the\x20stillness\x20was\x20the\x20hopping\x20of\x20the\x20canary\x20up\x20and\x20down\x20the\x20perches\x20of\x20its\x20prison.\x20\x20Then\x20she\x20looked\x20attentively\x20downwards.\x20\x20It\x20was\x20not\x20at\x20the\x20bird,\x20nor\x20at\x20the\x20cat;\x20it\x20was\x20at\x20an\x20oblong\x20package\x20tied\x20in\x20paper,\x20and\x20lying\x20between\x20them.\x20\x20She\x20turned\x20her\x20head\x20to\x20learn\x20if\x20the\x20waggoner\x20were\x20coming.\x20\x20He\x20was\x20not\x20yet\x20in\x20sight;\x20and\x20her\x20eyes\x20crept\x20back\x20to\x20the\x20package,\x20her\x20thoughts\x20seeming\x20to\x20run\x20upon\x20what\x20was\x20inside\x20it.\x20\x20At\x20length\x20she\x20drew\x20the\x20article\x20into\x20her\x20lap,\x20and\x20untied\x20the\x20paper\x20covering;\x20a\x20small\x20swing\x20looking-\x20glass\x20was\x20disclosed,\x20in\x20which\x20she\x20proceeded\x20to\x20survey\x20herself\x20attentively.\x20\x20She\x20parted\x20her\x20lips\x20and\x20smiled.\x20\x20It\x20was\x20a\x20fine\x20morning,\x20and\x20the\x20sun\x20lighted\x20up\x20to\x20a\x20scarlet\x20glow\x20the\x20crimson\x20jacket\x20she\x20wore,\x20and\x20painted\x20a\x20soft\x20lustre\x20upon\x20her\x20bright\x20face\x20and\x20dark\x20hair.\x20\x20The\x20myrtles,\x20geraniums,\x20and\x20cactuses\x20packed\x20around\x20her\x20were\x20fresh\x20and\x20green,\x20and\x20at\x20such\x20a\x20leafless\x20season\x20they\x20invested\x20the\x20whole\x20concern\x20of\x20horses,\x20waggon,\x20furniture,\x20and\x20girl\x20with\x20a\x20peculiar\x20vernal\x20charm.\x20\x20What\x20possessed\x20her\x20to\x20indulge\x20in\x20such\x20a\x20performance\x20in\x20the\x20sight\x20of\x20the\x20sparrows,\x20blackbirds,\x20and\x20unperceived\x20farmer\x20who\x20were\x20alone\x20its\x20spectators,\x20--\x20whether\x20the\x20smile\x20began\x20as\x20a\x20factitious\x20one,\x20to\x20test\x20her\x20capacity\x20in\x20that\x20art,\x20--\x20nobody\x20knows;\x20it\x20ended\x20certainly\x20in\x20a\x20real\x20smile.\x20\x20She\x20blushed\x20at\x20herself,\x20and\x20seeing\x20her\x20reflection\x20blush,\x20blushed\x20the\x20more.\x20\x20The\x20change\x20from\x20the\x20customary\x20spot\x20and\x20necessary\x20occasion\x20of\x20such\x20an\x20act\x20--\x20from\x20the\x20dressing\x20hour\x20in\x20a\x20bedroom\x20to\x20a\x20time\x20of\x20travelling\x20out\x20of\x20doors\x20--\x20lent\x20to\x20the\x20idle\x20deed\x20a\x20novelty\x20it\x20did\x20not\x20intrinsically\x20possess.\x20\x20The\x20picture\x20was\x20a\x20delicate\x20one.\x20\x20Woman's\x20prescriptive\x20infirmity\x20had\x20stalked\x20into\x20the\x20sunlight,\x20which\x20had\x20clothed\x20it\x20in\x20the\x20freshness\x20of\x20an\x20originality.\x20\x20A\x20cynical\x20inference\x20was\x20irresistible\x20by\x20Gabriel\x20Oak\x20as\x20he\x20regarded\x20the\x20scene,\x20generous\x20though\x20he\x20fain\x20would\x20have\x20been.\x20\x20There\x20was\x20no\x20necessity\x20whatever\x20for\x20her\x20looking\x20in\x20the\x20glass.\x20\x20She\x20did\x20not\x20adjust\x20her\x20hat,\x20or\x20pat\x20her\x20hair,\x20or\x20press\x20a\x20dimple\x20into\x20shape,\x20or\x20do\x20one\x20thing\x20to\x20signify\x20that\x20any\x20such\x20intention\x20had\x20been\x20her\x20motive\x20in\x20taking\x20up\x20the\x20glass.\x20\x20She\x20simply\x20observed\x20herself\x20as\x20a\x20fair\x20product\x20of\x20Nature\x20in\x20the\x20feminine\x20kind,\x20her\x20thoughts\x20seeming\x20to\x20glide\x20into\x20far-off\x20though\x20likely\x20dramas\x20in\x20which\x20men\x20would\x20play\x20a\x20part\x20--\x20vistas\x20of\x20probable\x20triumphs\x20--\x20the\x20smiles\x20being\x20of\x20a\x20phase\x20suggesting\x20that\x20hearts\x20were\x20imagined\x20as\x20lost\x20and\x20won.\x20\x20Still,\x20this\x20was\x20but\x20conjecture,\x20and\x20the\x20whole\x20series\x20of\x20actions\x20was\x20so\x20idly\x20put\x20forth\x20as\x20to\x20make\x20it\x20rash\x20to\x20assert\x20that\x20intention\x20had\x20any\x20part\x20in\x20them\x20at\x20all.\x20\x20The\x20waggoner's\x20steps\x20were\x20heard\x20returning.\x20\x20She\x20put\x20the\x20glass\x20in\x20the\x20paper,\x20and\x20the\x20whole\x20again\x20into\x20its\x20place.\x20\x20When\x20the\x20waggon\x20had\x20passed\x20on,\x20Gabriel\x20withdrew\x20from\x20his\x20point\x20of\x20espial,\x20and\x20descending\x20into\x20the\x20road,\x20followed\x20the\x20vehicle\x20to\x20the\x20turnpike-gate\x20some\x20way\x20beyond\x20the\x20bottom\x20of\x20the\x20hill,\x20where\x20the\x20object\x20of\x20his\x20contemplation\x20now\x20halted\x20for\x20the\x20payment\x20of\x20toll.\x20\x20About\x20twenty\x20steps\x20still\x20remained\x20between\x20him\x20and\x20the\x20gate,\x20when\x20he\x20heard\x20a\x20dispute.\x20\x20It\x20was\x20a\x20difference\x20concerning\x20twopence\x20between\x20the\x20persons\x20with\x20the\x20waggon\x20and\x20the\x20man\x20at\x20the\x20toll-bar.\x20\x20"Mis'ess's\x20niece\x20is\x20upon\x20the\x20top\x20of\x20the\x20things,\x20and\x20she\x20says\x20that's\x20enough\x20that\x20I've\x20offered\x20ye,\x20you\x20great\x20miser,\x20and\x20she\x20won't\x20pay\x20any\x20more."\x20\x20These\x20were\x20the\x20waggoner's\x20words.\x20\x20"Very\x20well;\x20then\x20mis'ess's\x20niece\x20can't\x20pass,"\x20said\x20the\x20turnpike-keeper,\x20closing\x20the\x20gate.\x20\x20Oak\x20looked\x20from\x20one\x20to\x20the\x20other\x20of\x20the\x20disputants,\x20and\x20fell\x20into\x20a\x20reverie.\x20\x20There\x20was\x20something\x20in\x20the\x20tone\x20of\x20twopence\x20remarkably\x20insignificant.\x20\x20Threepence\x20had\x20a\x20definite\x20value\x20as\x20money\x20--\x20it\x20was\x20an\x20appreciable\x20infringement\x20on\x20a\x20day's\x20wages,\x20and,\x20as\x20such,\x20a\x20higgling\x20matter;\x20but\x20twopence\x20--\x20"Here,"\x20he\x20said,\x20stepping\x20forward\x20and\x20handing\x20twopence\x20to\x20the\x20gatekeeper;\x20"let\x20the\x20young\x20woman\x20pass."\x20\x20He\x20looked\x20up\x20at\x20her\x20then;\x20she\x20heard\x20his\x20words,\x20and\x20looked\x20down.\x20\x20Gabriel's\x20features\x20adhered\x20throughout\x20their\x20form\x20so\x20exactly\x20to\x20the\x20middle\x20line\x20between\x20the\x20beauty\x20of\x20St.\x20John\x20and\x20the\x20ugliness\x20of\x20Judas\x20Iscariot,\x20as\x20represented\x20in\x20a\x20window\x20of\x20the\x20church\x20he\x20attended,\x20that\x20not\x20a\x20single\x20lineament\x20could\x20be\x20selected\x20and\x20called\x20worthy\x20either\x20of\x20distinction\x20or\x20notoriety.\x20\x20The\x20red-jacketed\x20and\x20dark-haired\x20maiden\x20seemed\x20to\x20think\x20so\x20too,\x20for\x20she\x20carelessly\x20glanced\x20over\x20him,\x20and\x20told\x20her\x20man\x20to\x20drive\x20on.\x20\x20She\x20might\x20have\x20looked\x20her\x20thanks\x20to\x20Gabriel\x20on\x20a\x20minute\x20scale,\x20but\x20she\x20did\x20not\x20speak\x20them;\x20more\x20probably\x20she\x20felt\x20none,\x20for\x20in\x20gaining\x20her\x20a\x20passage\x20he\x20had\x20lost\x20her\x20her\x20point,\x20and\x20we\x20know\x20how\x20women\x20take\x20a\x20favour\x20of\x20that\x20kind.\x20\x20The\x20gatekeeper\x20surveyed\x20the\x20retreating\x20vehicle.\x20\x20"That's\x20a\x20handsome\x20maid,"\x20he\x20said\x20to\x20Oak.\x20\x20"But\x20she\x20has\x20her\x20faults,"\x20said\x20Gabriel.\x20\x20"True,\x20farmer."\x20"And\x20the\x20greatest\x20of\x20them\x20is\x20--\x20well,\x20what\x20it\x20is\x20always."\x20"Beating\x20people\x20down?\x20ay,\x20'tis\x20so."\x20"O\x20no."\x20"What,\x20then?"\x20Gabriel,\x20perhaps\x20a\x20little\x20piqued\x20by\x20the\x20comely\x20traveller's\x20indifference,\x20glanced\x20back\x20to\x20where\x20he\x20had\x20witnessed\x20her\x20performance\x20over\x20the\x20hedge,\x20and\x20said,\x20"Vanity."	-	@glibc-sysregex-sed
